<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51225" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vīvesco</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vīvisco</span></b> ), vixi, 3, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>v. inch. n.</i>
			[vivo], <i>to become alive</i>, <i>get
				life</i>, <i>spring forth.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen., <i><span class="en">Plin. 9, 51,
				74, § 160</span></i>; <i><span class="en">16, 25, 39, §
			93</span></i>; <i><span class="en">17, 10, 10,
				§ 59</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Prud. Apoth.
			970</span></i>.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Pregn., <i>to grow lively</i>, <i>strong</i>, or <i>vigorous</i>, <i><span class="en">Lucr. 4,
				1138</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ulcus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					4, 1068</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">si utraque (arbor) vixerit,</span>”
				<i>if they both grow</i>, <i>succeed</i>,
					<i>thrive</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Col. Arb. 16, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">stolones avulsi arboribus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					17, 10, 13, § 67</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
